THIRD-PARTY FONTS

This project depends on three font packages from the @fontsource project:
@fontsource/archivo-black, @fontsource/inter and @fontsource/jetbrains-mono.
Those fonts are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, NOT MIT, and
each npm package carries its own LICENSE file with the full text.

The font binaries are deliberately not vendored into this repository.
`assets/fonts/` is gitignored and populated at build time by
`npm run build:assets`, so this repo distributes no font files and the OFL
attribution requirement does not attach to the source tree.

If you package this application for distribution, the built artifact DOES
embed those font files, and at that point OFL-1.1 requires you to ship the
copyright notice and license text alongside them.

THIRD-PARTY MAP LIBRARY

The map picker depends on the leaflet npm package, licensed BSD-2-Clause,
NOT MIT. Like the fonts, it is not vendored: `assets/vendor/` is gitignored
and populated at build time by `npm run build:assets`. A packaged artifact
embeds Leaflet, and BSD-2-Clause requires its copyright notice and license
text to ship alongside it. Map tiles come from OpenStreetMap at runtime and
are never distributed with the application; OpenStreetMap data is © OpenStreetMap
contributors, ODbL.
